  "chapter": "STARTING_OUT_WITH_LINES",
  "description": "§bRadon§r is a rare, vital element essential for higher tier components.

Your earliest access to §bRadon§r will be via §bEnder Air distillation§r. Later, a more complex method opens in the §bLarge Chemical Reactor§r, by reacting §eAir§r, §eUranium Dust§r, and §ePlutonium Ingots§r. As a last resort, §bRadon§r can also be produced in a §bFusion Reactor§r.

This gas is crucial for crafting §dQuantum Eyes§r, §dQuantum Stars§r, and §dQubit Wafers§r, which are foundational for the §bLuV circuit line§r and beyond.

§r§l§6Strategic Tip:§r Prioritize setting up an §o§6Ender Air distillation§r§o line as your initial sustainable source for this indispensable element.",
